            and vertical spaces like cat trees. Enrichment helps prevent boredom, supports
            exercise, and reduces unwanted behavior.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="example">
        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-4">
          <span>Why does my cat knead blankets or laps?</span>
          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="details" id="faq-4" hidden>
          <p>
            Kneading is a common behavior that starts in kittenhood and often carries into
            adulthood. Many cats knead when they feel calm, cozy, or affectionate, and it
            can be a sign that they feel relaxed in their environment.
          </p>
        </div>
